Description: simple graphical updater for system packages and Flatpak apps
 Update Helper checks for updates, shows what will change, and installs
 the updates when asked: system packages through apt first, then Flatpak
 apps and runtimes.
 .
 Packages that ask questions while installing, such as debconf dialogs,
 configuration file prompts or repository key imports, are answered in a
 terminal inside the window, so no separate terminal opens.
